{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Forged Into History: Speedway Odyssey</i> is an arcade motorbike racing game that lets you take part in an individual fight for the championship in the top league of a speedway competition. Compete over multiple career seasons and prove that you are the true champion.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In <i>Speedway Odyssey</i> players will see their avatar from a top-down view in a 2D setting on a set of varied round and oval tracks. Each track features a unique combination of static fast (or slow) lanes and a distinct shape providing players with a diverse experience. Your competition for each new game start will be a group of randomly generated AI players of varied difficulty levels.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The game allows for up to 4 players to play locally on a single computer. All game modes (single race, single tournament and career) can be played locally, requiring either a keyboard that supports multiple simultaneous key presses or additional controllers. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In Speedway Odyssey players are given the option to set the number of seasons the career will span, ranging from 1 to 20 seasons. At the start of each career, historical rankings are randomly generated, allowing players to ascend a new set each time. Alternatively, with a switch in options, rankings may start empty.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Earn your title and don't let other pretenders take it away from you. Show that you are the true legend of speedway!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3447910?t=1751370179","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3447910?t=1751370179","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3447910/7d4eed3c74a3f6d745e5cc243b674607b8377f7c/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1751370179","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3447910/7d4eed3c74a3f6d745e5cc243b674607b8377f7c/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1751370179","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen PvP","id":37},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen","id":24},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":3772320,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Forged Into History: Speedway Odyssey</i> is an arcade motorbike racing game that lets you take part in an individual fight for the championship in the top league of a speedway competition. Compete over multiple career seasons and prove that you are the true champion.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In <i>Speedway Odyssey</i> players will see their avatar from a top-down view in a 2D setting on a set of varied round and oval tracks. Each track features a unique combination of static fast (or slow) lanes and a distinct shape providing players with a diverse experience. Your competition for each new game start will be a group of randomly generated AI players of varied difficulty levels.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The game allows for up to 4 players to play locally on a single computer. All game modes (single race, single tournament and career) can be played locally, requiring either a keyboard that supports multiple simultaneous key presses or additional controllers. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In Speedway Odyssey players are given the option to set the number of seasons the career will span, ranging from 1 to 20 seasons. At the start of each career, historical rankings are randomly generated, allowing players to ascend a new set each time. Alternatively, with a switch in options, rankings may start empty.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Earn your title and don't let other pretenders take it away from you. Show that you are the true legend of speedway!</p>","developers":["ARRGAR Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Racing","id":"9"},{"description":"Sports","id":"18"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3447910/header.jpg?t=1751370179","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257151007,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257151007/movie480.mp4?t=1749039327","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257151007/movie_max.mp4?t=1749039327"},"name":"FIHSO Gameplay Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257151007/23103dd8f0446c84dca6829a50057220892e068e/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1749039327","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257151007/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1749039327","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257151007/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1749039327"}},{"highlight":true,"id":257111268,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257111268/movie480.mp4?t=1741275806","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257111268/movie_max.mp4?t=1741275806"},"name":"FIHSO gameplay teaser","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257111268/db8508ed01d01ec026f4f81a0959bc1b1e554f6a/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1741275806","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257111268/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1741275806","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257111268/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1741275806"}}],"name":"Forged Into History: Speedway Odyssey","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><st